\ designs/portable-arm/genes.4 - portable-arm's genes for forth/cross-cv8.4, written by lab/evolve/export-genes.py from the
\ options the evolver hands the translator (tools/layout.py) and the engine's flags. Include it before
\ cross-cv8.4: S" extend.4" INCLUDED  S" genes.4" INCLUDED  S" cross-cv8.4" INCLUDED
: G-OVERLAYS ( --- c-addr u ) S" cv8.4 cv8b.4 cv8b-kfast.4 cv8b-kinput.4 cv8b-klookup.4 cv8-fuse.4 cv8-fuse-imm.4 cv8-fuse-loopall.4 cv8-fuse-iplus.4 file-sysc.4 file-sysc2.4 " ;          \ after kernel.4, in this order
: G-FOLDS ( --- c-addr u ) S" + = ! @ LSHIFT RSHIFT C@ AND OR LIT < U< OVER DROP DUP SWAP >R R> R@ NEGATE C! " ;     \ the fold set: FOLD-BASE + place
31 CONSTANT G-SPEC          \ the specialisations: 1 small, 2 imm, 4 var, 8 tiny, 16 loc
: G-SUPERS ( --- c-addr u ) S" + @ 62 DUP >R 63 C! R> 64 >R C! 65 ROT DUP 66 R@ ROT 67 " ;    \ fused pairs: first second opcode
: G-OPS10 ( --- c-addr u ) S" SWAP+I 126 I+ 127 (FIND) 94 (>NUMBER) 95 SCAN 36 SKIP 37 FILL 38 (PARSE) 39 HASH 40 PLACE 41 (DO) 42 (LOOP) 43 (+LOOP) 44 (?DO) 45 (LEAVE) 46 I 47 J 48 UNLOOP 49 0= 50 BRANCH8 51 U<?BRANCH 52 <?BRANCH8 53 DUP+I 54 DUP<I 55 OVER?BRANCH 56 <?BRANCH 57 2@ 58 2! 59 > 60 +! 61 " ;     \ format-10 operations: name opcode
0 CONSTANT G-HOTCALLS      \ one-byte calls, at most
-1 CONSTANT G-OP-BODIES     \ the format-10 words' bodies their opcode
-1 CONSTANT G-OP-INLINE     \ ...placed among the primitives
-1 CONSTANT G-BSS           \ TIB, POCKET, INCLUDE-BUFFER past the image's end
-1 CONSTANT G-THIN-HEADER   \ one empty thread head in the file
32 CONSTANT G-THREADS       \ the dictionary's hash threads
: G-REBIND ( --- c-addr u ) S" OPEN-FILE CLOSE-FILE WRITE-FILE ALLOCATE FREE " ;    \ the kernel's uses rebound to the overlays' words
: G-HEADERLESS ( --- c-addr u ) S" FS-BLK FS0 FS1 FS2 FS3 FS4 FS-DROP FS-WRITE FS-NL FS-MMAP FS-OFL FS-END FS-SAVED " ;
1 CONSTANT G-ENGINE-SPEC   \ the engine's flags: SPEC (the locals block in the header)
29 CONSTANT G-FEATURES      \ the image's feature bits (engine/vm-lab.c's IMAGE_MAGIC)
76 CONSTANT G-MAGIC5
\ not yet: --escape
\ not yet: --rtfuse
